{"id":"c13","stage":2,"title":"说说上个周末","scene":"用过去时分享一次经历。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c13-1","ko":"지난 주말에 뭐 했어요?","zh":"上周末做什么了？","note":"했어요 是 하다 的过去式。","words":[{"term":"주말","zh":"周末","id":"dc80d0fe24783537","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"},{"term":"하다","zh":"做","id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/d4ca78d2b157c68184e7.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"지난","meaning":"上一个","explanation":"지난修饰时间名词，表示过去的。","readings":[{"term":"지난","audio":"/audio/1589c16515823209ca51.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난","audio":"/audio/1589c16515823209ca51.mp3"}},{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말（周末）+ 에（时间）。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에","audio":"/audio/ff068f34f21f5a2dea38.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐为무엇的口语形式，宾格助词省略。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"했어요?","meaning":"做了？","explanation":"하다（做）的过去礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어요","audio":"/audio/767a8404e5a0794daaf5.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c13-2","ko":"친구하고 부산에 다녀왔어요.","zh":"我和朋友去了一趟釜山。","note":"다녀오다 表示去了又回来。","words":[{"term":"친구","zh":"朋友","id":"1202aff936337891","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"},{"term":"부산","zh":"釜山","id":"6c9db53be31faa0c","audio":"/audio/6c9db53be31faa0c66e0.mp3"},{"term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟后回来","id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/467bc1b29a9cacb5f724.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"친구하고","meaning":"和朋友","explanation":"친구（朋友）+ 하고（和，口语助词）。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구하고","audio":"/audio/5560a34682deff9e2259.mp3"}},{"text":"부산에","meaning":"到釜山","explanation":"부산（釜山）+ 에（目的地）。","readings":[{"term":"부산","audio":"/audio/6c9db53be31faa0c66e0.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부산에","audio":"/audio/c8a2c47709271e3a57b8.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀왔어요.","meaning":"去了一趟","explanation":"다녀오다（去后回来）+ 过去时-았- + -어요。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀왔어요","audio":"/audio/061149a81c5ed6a290a3.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c13-3","ko":"바다는 어땠어요?","zh":"大海怎么样？","note":"어땠어요 询问过去的感受。","words":[{"term":"바다","zh":"大海","id":"1ea5c356f65344cf","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/a34270a3babcc60e2443.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"바다는","meaning":"大海","explanation":"바다（大海）+ 는（话题）。","readings":[{"term":"바다","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바다는","audio":"/audio/1403809a2706d0060c54.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어요?","meaning":"怎么样？","explanation":"어떻다（怎么样）的过去礼貌形式，问过去的感受。","readings":[{"term":"어땠어요","audio":"/audio/93cb69622b41f67a2913.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어요","audio":"/audio/93cb69622b41f67a2913.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c13-4","ko":"생각보다 아름다웠어요.","zh":"比想象中还美。","note":"아름답다 的 ㅂ 在这里变为 우。","words":[{"term":"생각","zh":"想法；想象","id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"},{"term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽","id":"b39be518859c28e0","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/b9ea2bef05a9483d943f.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"생각보다","meaning":"比想象","explanation":"생각（想法、想象）+ 보다（比较基准）。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각보다","audio":"/audio/60c489add64a605ce212.mp3"}},{"text":"아름다웠어요.","meaning":"更美","explanation":"아름답다（美丽）→ 아름다웠어요；ㅂ不规则变化后接过去礼貌语尾。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름다웠어요","audio":"/audio/902f0f652fe5605bf518.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c13-5","ko":"사진도 많이 찍었겠네요.","zh":"那一定也拍了很多照片吧。","note":"-겠네요 根据情境作出推测。","words":[{"term":"사진","zh":"照片","id":"1f872b5045690a7e","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"},{"term":"찍다","zh":"拍摄","id":"e1e4a89817058245","audio":"/aud